Mon Nov  2 03:05:33 PM MST 2026

"Installer" download can be found at http://www.dwyco.com

Source code is on github.com, search for "dwyco".

For Linux, the best way to run it is to download the AppImage if it is
available from www.dwyco.com.

For Mac, there is a DMG file. You'll have to tell MacOS to open the image
since it doesn't come from the Mac appstore.

For Windows, www.dwyco.com has a normal .exe installer.

